  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/P1410605.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(30 fotos) Este jueves ha abierto sus puertas en la calle Salvador Barri, 12 de Onda RAUL Tauleta i begudes, con servicio de cafeter&iacute;a, venta de pan, boller&iacute;a y chucher&iacute;as.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/P1410638.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Adem&aacute;s, realizan por encargo buffets para eventos y bolsas para cumplea&ntilde;os y fiestas. Todo tan f&aacute;cil como llamar al tel&eacute;fono 686 60 78 86 y pedir presupuesto sin compromiso.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtauletaraul/p1410594.jpg\" alt=\"p1410594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtauletaraul/p1410598.jpg\" alt=\"p1410598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtauletaraul/p1410599.jpg\" alt=\"p1410599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtauletaraul/p1410601.jpg\" alt=\"p1410601\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtauletaraul/p1410602.jpg\" alt=\"p1410602\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtauletaraul/p1410605.jpg\" alt=\"p1410605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtauletaraul/p1410606.jpg\" alt=\"p1410606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtauletaraul/p1410608.jpg\" alt=\"p1410608\" style=\"max-width:10